---
source: tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Search sources across the repository

Usage: mf source search [OPTIONS] <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <QUERY>  Search query

Options:
      --mode <MODE>            Search mode: basic (metadata), advanced (content), or both (fused)
                               [possible values: basic, advanced, both]
      --root <PATH>            Mind Repo root directory
      --config <PATH>          Config file path
  -p, --project <PROJECT>      Limit search to a specific project
      --file-kind <FILE_KIND>  Filter by file kind
  -v, --verbose...             Verbose output
  -q, --quiet                  Silence non-error output
      --source <SOURCE>        Filter by source identity
      --label <KEY=VALUE>      Filter by label, `key=value` (repeatable; all must match)
  -o, --output <FORMAT>        Output format [default: text] [possible values: text, json]
      --json                   Shorthand for --output json
      --revision <REV>         Search a specific content revision instead of the current version.
                               Accepts an integer revision number, a date (2026-07-25), or a
                               relative date (yesterday, "7 days ago")
      --limit <LIMIT>          Maximum results to return [default: 20]
      --no-color               Disable colored output
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
